  "title": "Virtual Memory Management",
  "abstract": "This thesis studies methods of scheduling, memory management, and load control in a virtual memory computer system. It also studies the problem of modeling virtual memory systems. The work contributes new ideas and techniques' in each of these arcas. Finally, the thesis compares the two alternative classes-local and global-of virtual memory management politics.",
